{"id":"n49650-1-7","stage":5,"title":"따돌리다 · 排挤","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49650-1-7-1","ko":"나만 따돌리고 너희끼리만 놀러 간 거야?","zh":"你们把我撇下，自己去玩了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나만","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나만","audio":"/audio/94653aba30449d7af9cc.mp3"}},{"text":"따돌리고","meaning":"排挤，排斥","explanation":"따돌리다：排挤，排斥；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"따돌리다","audio":"/audio/e0797dc793d0a1e8e4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49650","senseId":"1","lemma":"따돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따돌리고","audio":"/audio/3ec5d4cf6a1fc657e422.mp3"}},{"text":"너희끼리만","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们；끼리：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희끼리만","audio":"/audio/3612f3c5999b4502c7ff.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀러","audio":"/audio/56ad7f4b97efb1434426.mp3"}},{"text":"간","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e0797dc793d0a1e8","term":"따돌리다","zh":"排挤，排斥","audio":"/audio/e0797dc793d0a1e8e4a4.mp3","entryId":"49650","definition":"远离或欺负怨恨或讨厌的人。","pronunciation":["따돌리다"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/077212498fa515abc4da.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49650-1-7-2","ko":"아니야. 어제 네가 집안일이 있다고 일찍 들어갔잖아.","zh":"没有啊，昨天你说家里有事，先回去了嘛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아니야：不是，不对","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29726","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"집안일이","meaning":"家务","explanation":"집안일：家务；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집안일","audio":"/audio/3ec24ed09c58763add0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37042","senseId":"1","lemma":"집안일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집안일이","audio":"/audio/86bc506d4fd40132d7d3.mp3"}},{"text":"있다고","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다고","audio":"/audio/4df9048dde2a8a3e535d.mp3"}},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}},{"text":"들어갔잖아.","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어갔잖아","audio":"/audio/5bfff2dc5e584aed20c8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b8a273e5d75f1fd1","term":"아니야","zh":"不是，不对","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3","entryId":"29726","definition":"用于回答提问，表示强调或坚决否定。","pronunciation":["아니야"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"3ec24ed09c58763a","term":"집안일","zh":"家务","audio":"/audio/3ec24ed09c58763add0a.mp3","entryId":"37042","definition":"打扫、洗衣服、做饭等家庭的日常事务。","pronunciation":["지반닐"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/74c1f6730becc671e2e7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.502,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49650","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.8773,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有啊，昨天你说家里有事，先回去了嘛。","去爷爷家，给他买什么点心好？","你们把我撇下，自己去玩了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["没有啊，昨天你说家里有事，先回去了嘛。","你们把我撇下，自己去玩了？","去爷爷家，给他买什么点心好？"],"answer":0}]}
